// Message catalog for deimos::i18n. Included from src/core/support/i18n.cpp.
//
// Rules for editors:
//  - Every key must exist in both ENGLISH_ENTRIES and RUSSIAN_ENTRIES, in the same
//    order. tests/test_i18n.cpp fails when the two key sets diverge.
//  - Diagnostic entries are named "diag." + the diagnostic code used in the source,
//    so a message can always be traced back to a stable machine readable code.
//  - Use {0}, {1}, ... for arguments; translators may reorder them.
//  - Do not translate tool names (winws, nfqws, tpws), file names or flag names.

